"Binding contract (abyssal demon)",
"Requires a minimum of 85 Summoning, 85 Slayer and a binding contract.",
"These items are rolled before other drops and replace any other drops if successful.\010\010First, if the player is on an appropriate slayer task, there is a 1/3052 (1/3021 with tier 3 or higher luck) chance to recieve a wand or orb (so 1/6104 each). If not successful or not on-task, there is a 1/1024 (1/993 with tier 3 luck) chance to recieve a whip.\010\010If both of these rolls fail and a Most Wanted card (abyssal demons) is carried, a second more generous roll for each is performed. If on task, a 1/2900 roll (1/2871 with tier 3 luck) roll for wand/orb, and then a 1/973 roll (1/963 with tier 3 luck) for a whip. Combining all these chances give a 1/2976.0 chance for a wand or orb (each; 1/2946.1 with tier 3 luck) per on-task kill, and a 1/499.4 chance for a whip (1/489.4 with tier 3 luck) per on-task kill (off-task is slightly more likely at 1/499.2 and 1/489.1). If one of these second rolls results in a drop, additional charges are consumed from the card: 4 for a whip, 19 for an orb, and 99 for a wand, in addition to the normal 1 charge per kill.",
