"These items are rolled before other drops and replace any other drops if successful, except charms.\010\010First, if the player is on an appropriate slayer task, there is a 1/750 (1/742 with tier 3 or higher luck) chance to recieve a wand or orb (so 1/750 each). If not successful or not on-task, there is a 1/500 (1/485 with tier 3 luck) chance to recieve a whip.\010\010If both of these rolls fail and a Most Wanted card (abyssal demons) is carried, a second roll for each is performed. If on task, a 1/750 roll (1/742 with tier 3 luck) roll for wand/orb, and then a 1/450 roll (1/445 with tier 3 luck) for a whip. Combining all these chances give a 1/751.3 chance for a wand or orb (each; 1/743.3 with tier 3 luck) per on-task kill, and a 1/237.4 chance for a whip (1/232.8 with tier 3 luck) per on-task kill (off-task is slightly more likely at 1/237.1 and 1/232.3). If one of these second rolls results in a drop, additional charges are consumed from the card: 4 for a whip, 19 for an orb, and 99 for a wand, in addition to the normal 1 charge per kill.",
