"1/240; 1/480",
"Any of the three weapon add-ons may be obtained from any version of Araxxor. The chances of receiving the add-on corresponding to Araxxor's primary combat style is 1/240 whilst the other two add-ons each have a 1/480 chance of dropping. This is a 1/120 base chance of any add-on in solo. See Weapon add-on scenarios below for further information. Drop rate increased by 1% with tier 4 luck active.",
