"1/1,000–1/500",
"Not an actual drop. Upon Araxxi's death, if a pet is successfully rolled, it will appear in the Pets interface. If the pet does not appear after Araxxi's death, you have the option to gamble all of your drops for a second chance at the pet. You must roll a 0 in order to get the pet. The drop rate varies from 1/500–1/1,000, depending on the enrage Araxxor accumulated throughout the fight (starting enrage excluded).",
"Araxyte egg",
"Has a base drop rate of 1/500 with a threshold of 200. In addition, having unlocked the Araxyte pets that are not Barry or Mallory is required to be eligible for this drop. First egg unlocks Barry, which is required to obtain the second egg, which unlocks Mallory.",
