"Automaton Generator",
"Automaton generators encountered during The World Wakes drop nothing.\010\010The initial roll for uniques is 1/512 (1/506 with tier 3 or higher luck active), followed by a 1/2 roll to get tracking gloves or cresbot - if cresbot is already owned or unlocked, 45,000-55,000 coins are dropped instead. If a Most Wanted card (automatons) is carried, a second more generous roll is performed: 1/486 (1/481 with tier 3 luck). If the second roll succeeds, cresbot is guaranteed to be dropped if not yet unlocked, and tracking gloves are guaranteed if it is (there is no coins option for the second roll). Combining all these chances gives a roughly 1/330 chance per kill for gloves once cresbot is unlocked (1/326.5 with tier 3 luck). If the second roll results in a unique drop, 99 charges are drained from the card, in addition to the usual 1 charge per kill.\010\010Receiving a unique prevents all other drops except charms.",
"Tracking gloves",
