"First version - level 14 / 100% drops",
"The main drop table is split into two versions.\010\010The first version is tied to the barbarians that have Acelin, Adelino, Adolpho, Edelschwarz, Fafner, Gutrune, Hagen, Lydspor, Siegfried, Sieglinde, or Wotan as their name in their examine text. The second version is tied to the ones with Aitan, Alberich, Brunnhilde, Fasolt, Minarch, or Siegmund. Only Lydspor and Gutrune drop charms, spirit gems, and mimic kill tokens.\010\010Alberich, Brunnhilde, Edelschwarz, Fafner, Fasolt, Minarch and Siegfried can be found at the Barbarian Outpost.\010\010Acelin, Adelino, Adolpho, Aitan, Edelschwarz, Fafner, Gutrune, Hagen, Lydspor, Minarch, Siegfried, Sieglinde and Wotan can be found outside the Longhouse of the Barbarian Village.\010\010Alberich, Brunnhilde, Fasolt, Fosfar and Siegmund can be found inside the Longhouse of the village.",
