"Glacor",
"Glacyte boots drop table",
"The player has a 1/128 (1/126 with tier 3 or higher luck active) chance of accessing this table. Every drop on this table then has equal chance of being accessed, making every individual drop 1/1,280 (1/1260 with tier 3 luck). In addition to the 7 specific drops displayed on the table below, the player also has a chance at receiving 1 random tree seed, 4 random noted herbs, or 2 random noted herbs, for a total of 10 possible drops.\010\010If the player is carrying a Most Wanted card (glacors) and they fail to access this table, a second roll is performed to attempt to drop boots. This roll is a more generous 1/406 (1/401 with tier 3 luck), which then drops one of the three boots (1/3 chance each). Combining these chances gives an overall 1/626.6 chance to receive each type of boot per kill (1/617.9 with tier 3 luck). Receiving boots as a result of the second roll will drain 99 charges from the card, in addition to the 1 charge per kill. It is worth noting that the second roll is not performed if something else from this table is dropped, as the check is only for accessing this table.",
