"cite_note-trove-15",
"The chance of obtaining a piece of the fractured staff of Armadyl is 1/400 per loot pile, or ~1/133 per solo boss kill. If the player has never had a staff component drop before or has equal numbers of each piece on their drop log, a random component of the three (Staff of Armadyl's fractured shaft, Fractured stabilisation gem, Fractured Armadyl symbol) is dropped; the drop will be the next piece missing in the sequence of shaft, gem, symbol. The drop chance is improved to 1/392 with the enriched pontifex shadow ring active, 1/396 with tier 4 luck active, or 1/388 with both active.\010\010If the staff component roll fails, there is a 1/180 chance of obtaining the scripture, wrist wraps or codex per loot pile (one of the three is chosen at random), or ~1/60 per solo boss kill. The drop chance is improved to 1/176 with the enriched pontifex shadow ring active, 1/178 with tier 4 luck active, or 1/174 with both active.\010\010This, in turn, means a ~1/124 chance for any unique drops per loot pile, or a ~1/41 chance per solo boss kill (~1/120 per pile, ~1/40 per solo kill with the enriched shadow pontifex ring and tier 4 luck active).",
