"When the Phoenix is mortally wounded, she will move to the pyre. The player must then set the pyre on fire, burning the Phoenix and turning her to ash. She will quickly be reborn. The player may then speak with the new Phoenix and be rewarded with two phoenix quills.\010\010For every kill, the player will also receive 250 Slayer experience (5,000 Slayer experience is awarded the first time she is killed), 3,750 Firemaking experience, 1,500 Fletching experience, and 500 Crafting experience as a reward for defeating her, as well as a 1/100 chance to get a phoenix eggling pet. In order to roll for the pet, the player has to exit via the cave entrance instead of teleporting out.",
