"All four variants of the revenant goblin have the same drops, but as revenant drop chances depend on the combat level of the revenant, the chances change between the variants.\010\010Revenant drops are not affected by luck. There are only two ways to increase the drop rate of revenant items: completion of the elite Wilderness achievements which gives a 5% increased chance for revenant drops, and revenant drop enhancers, which give a 10% increased chance. Both boosts can be in effect at the same time.\010\010The ghostlevel used to calculate the drop rates of the level 16 revenant goblin's unique items is 4, and the revnumber is 15000. Drop chances are increased by 5% if elite Wilderness achievements are completed, and by 10% if the revenant drop enhancer in the backpack or currency pouch, stacks with the former.",
"8,924/15,000",
"The maximum amount of coins that can be received is equal to fifty times the ghostlevel (4), and the minimum is always 50.\010\010If on a relevant Slayer task, coins chance slightly reduced and replaced by ancient warriors equipment patch.\010\010Coins numerator is capped at 8924.",
