"Chipped black stone crystal has a base drop rate of 1/300 with a threshold of 60. Example: If a player were to have 101 group and 144 solo (combined 245), it would be 4 thresholds for solo, 1 threshold for duo and 0 thresholds for trio.\010\010Rolled for before the rest of the main drop table and replaces that drop if obtained.\010\010Jagex. Mod Orion's Twitter account. 10 October 2018. (Archived from the original on 30 May 2020.) Mod Orion: \"Futon has 245 kills: You have a 4x higher chance to receive the pet on solo mode. You have not yet reached the threshold on group mode.\"\010\010Jagex. Mod Orion's Twitter account. 10 October 2018. (Archived from the original on 30 May 2020.) Mod Orion: \"Correct. We're VERY happy that our systems allow us to re-use the previous elite dungeon code for new ones.\"\010\010Jagex. Mod Orion's Twitter account. 17 May 2019. (Archived from the original on 17 May 2019.) Mod Orion: \"Elite dungeon duo pet rates and thresholds btw\"\010\010Jagex. Mod Sponge's Twitter account. 7 December 2021. (Archived from the original on 16 April 2022.) Mod Sponge: \"If you happen to roll pet, you never reach this table (it is a separate roll, that returns before this is reached)\"",
