"The chance per person (regardless of team size) to hit the shared crossbow drop is 1/200 with a 50% chance to hit either main-hand or off-hand crossbow. Multiple crossbows can be obtained across the team in one kill; any individual may only obtain one per kill. Drop rate improved to 1/396 with tier 4 luck.\010\010Jagex. Mod Ramen's Twitter account. 25 February 2020. (Archived from the original on 2 March 2020.) Mod Ramen: \"Yes and yes\" In response to the question: \"With scalable Solak coming this upcoming Monday, are the crossbow rates still going to be the previously planned 1/200 per person across all team sizes?\"",
